> - 对象类：foreground_object, marker_pixel, sprite, template, indicator_region, square_canvas, foreground_rectangle, sparse_marker, blank_region, hollow_rectangle, isolated_pixel, canvas_boundary, separator_line, grid_cell, row_pattern, canvas, tile(obj), multicolor_template, solid_rectangle, monochrome_rect, color_frequency, half_outline, symmetry_axis, filled_rectangle, foreground_shape, square, start_marker, end_marker, control_sprite, polychrome_tile, indicator_pixel
